abine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.  Moonglade lies between Felwood and Winterspring, accessible through a path out of Timbermaw Hold.","start":{"name":"Mathrengyl Bearwalker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[35.2,8]},"end":{"name":"Rabine Saturna","kind":"npc","zone":493,"zoneName":"Moonglade","coord":[51.6,44.8]},"chain":{"id":"1015","step":3,"length":8},"rewards":{"xp":1400,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Cenarion Circle",25]]}},{"id":1047,"name":"The New Frontier","level":55,"reqLevel":54,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Speak with Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm at the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus about the Cenarion Circle's call to explore the frontiers of Kalimdor.","start":{"name":"Herald Moonstalker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[32.4,41.4]},"end":{"name":"Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[34.8,8.8]},"chain":{"id":"1015","step":1,"length":8},"rewards":{"xp":560,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[]}},{"id":6761,"name":"The New Frontier","level":55,"reqLevel":54,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker at the Cenarion Enclave of Darnassus.","start":{"name":"Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[34.8,8.8]},"end":{"name":"Mathrengyl Bearwalker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[35.2,8]},"chain":{"id":"1015","step":2,"length":8},"rewards":{"xp":560,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",10]]}},{"id":7799,"name":"A Donation of Mageweave","level":60,"reqLevel":40,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Mageweave is running low, and we could use your help to replenish our stocks!  By counting on the community as a whole, we would only need a donation of 60 pieces of mageweave cloth from you to enable us to reach our goal.  Such generosity would not go unnoticed by Darnassus, I assure you!If you have the sixty pieces of mageweave cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.","start":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"end":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"rewards":{"xp":3300,"money":19800,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",150]]}},{"id":7800,"name":"A Donation of Runecloth","level":60,"reqLevel":50,"side":"Alliance","summary":"<name>, you've been a tremendous contributor to our cloth drive.  As we work hard to replenish our reserves, one form of cloth remains critically low - runecloth.  We are in absolutely dire need of it, and we hope that you will be able to help us as you have in the past!If you are willing, please bring me what runecloth you can spare.  We'll initially accept a single donation of sixty, and then we'll go from there.","start":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"end":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"rewards":{"xp":6600,"money":39600,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",150]]}},{"id":7798,"name":"A Donation of Silk","level":60,"reqLevel":26,"side":"Alliance","summary":"As with most other fabrics, our stocks of silk are at an all-time low.  Our stores are such that we'd only need sixty pieces of silk from you total; we should be able to reach our goal with the support of others.A benevolent gift such as silk, might I add, would certainly increase your local standing in the community!  If you have the sixty pieces of silk cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.","start":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"end":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"rewards":{"xp":1650,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",150]]}},{"id":7792,"name":"A Donation of Wool","level":60,"reqLevel":12,"side":"Alliance","summary":"We are currently accepting donations for wool cloth.  A donation of sixty pieces of wool cloth will net you full recognition by Darnassus for your generous actions.  Our stores are such on wool that we would only need sixty pieces from you total; we should be able to acquire enough from others in the realm to support our drive.If you have the sixty pieces of wool cloth on you and are ready to donate them, I'm able to take them from you now.","start":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"end":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"rewards":{"xp":660,"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",150]]}},{"id":7801,"name":"Additional Runecloth","level":60,"reqLevel":50,"side":"Alliance","summary":"Greetings once again, <name>!  Our need for runecloth is constant, and we can always use additional resources if you are willing to part with them.  For an additional stack of twenty runecloth, I will make sure that you are recognized for your continuing efforts on behalf of Darnassus.Whenever you are ready to hand in the stack of runecloth, I'll accept it.","start":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"end":{"name":"Raedon Duskstriker","kind":"npc","zone":1657,"zoneName":"Darnassus","coord":[63.8,22.8]},"rewards":{"choices":[],"items":[],"rep":[["Darnassus",50]]}}],"chains":{"26":[[{"id":26,"name":"A Lesson to Learn","level":16,"side":"Alliance","zone":"Darnassus"}],[{"id":29,"name":"Trial of the Lake","level":16,"side":"Alliance","zone":"Moonglade"}],[{"id":272,"name":"Trial of the Sea Lion","level":16,"side":"Alliance","zone":"Moonglade"}],[{"id":5061,"name":"Aquatic Form","level":16,"side":"Alliance","zone":"Moonglade"}]],"730":[[{"id":730,"name":"Trouble In Darkshore?","level":14,"side":"Alliance","zone":"Darnassus"}],[{"id":729,"name":"T